st some of the things  I would like to see in the end the next  question is from Josh and he asked what  reunion am I most excited to see in  season 8 thanks for the question Josh  this is a pretty easy one for me to  answer though reunion I want to see the  most is a full-on stark reunion I want  to see all of the Starks in one room at  the same time this is something that  needs to happen before the series ends  this is another way I want this series  to end is all of the Starks seeing each  other one last time especially John and  Arya these two have a bond that cannot  be broken  aurilla perfectly demonstrated this in  season 7 when she made sure Sansa wasn't  about to betray Jon in any way John and  arias relationship is about as strong as  all of the Starks relationships were  with their dire wolves in the books John  an aria think about each other all the  time they miss each other more than any  of the other siblings and it will be  really nice to see these two get to hug  each other again I can't wait to see the  smile on John's face when he sees Arya  still has neo at her side  I feel like this will be one of the  reunions that could actually make me cry  next season and I won't feel ashamed for  doing so even Sansa said so herself John  is gonna freak out when he sees Arya  again I personally can't wait for this  but all of the Starks reuniting will  fill very satisfying it was the first  family we were introduced to and they're  the family that I love the most the next  question says do you believe that Varys  betrayed Daenerys how did Cersei and  Jaime know Daenerys Centurions war plans  thank you for the question Lana I'm not  exactly sure if Varys has betrayed  Daenerys already but I do believe Varys  will betray her at some point next  season there were a few things that were  said to Varys over the last two seasons  that made me believe he will die because  of a betrayal the first person to  question Varys was kin Vera and she told  Varys that as long as he supports the  Narus then he has nothing to fear from  the red priests then she also asked  various if he wanted to know what was  said in the flames and this scared his  [ __ ] out of Eros I think in vara knows  Varys will double-cross the queen and it  has something to do with what was said  to him in the flames beerus his own  death may have been revealed to him as a  little boy but he doesn't want to  believe it but when can Vora mentioned  the flames to him they scared him  because it made it even more real then  Melisandre told Varys he was going to  die in Westeros she didn't say when so  technically he could die as an old man  but they wouldn't have had Melisandre  say that to Varys unless it was gonna  happen soon  Varys his death will be connected to  Melisandre or Canberra and I think he  has known this ever since he was a  little boy this is why he hates magic  and any red priest he meets Daenerys  also told Varys that never betray her or  else she would burn him with her dragons  and I believe all of this is  foreshadowing Varys is betrayal to me  that just feels like the direction  they're going to go in but I could be  wrong like I said but I think this is a  good place to stop today's video I want  to thank everyone for posting your  questions I really appreciate that I  will be uploading another video tomorrow  so I hope to see you all come back for  that one I also want to thank all of my  new patreon supporters much love to  everyone that has signed up and helped  this channel have a great day everyone  I'll see you soon  by  Oh
 

